<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys 12-mo net up 32.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Hayleys 12-mo net up 32.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     7,113.00    vs    5,508.06</p>
<p>    Net profit	     283.15    vs	213.74</p>
<p>    Tax			165.42    vs	165.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Hayleys Ltd is one of three diversified blue chip holding companies listed in Colombo. The company consolidates the accounts of 65 units, eight of which are listed.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
